flowchart LR
  subgraph PLAT[Social platforms]
    FB[Facebook / Instagram]
    YT[YouTube]
    LI[LinkedIn]
  end

  FB -->|webhook| APIM[API Mgmt / Front Door]
  APIM --> WH[Webhook receiver<br/>Container App]
  POLL[Pollers<br/>Container Apps Jobs] <-->|poll| YT
  POLL <-->|poll| LI

  KV[(Key Vault<br/>tokens)] -.-> WH
  KV -.-> POLL
  KV -.-> PUB

  WH --> SB[[Service Bus]]
  POLL --> SB
  WH --> BLOB[(Blob Storage<br/>raw payloads + source docs)]

  subgraph FND[Microsoft Foundry]
    LLM[LLM + embedding models]
    DI[Document Intelligence<br/>OCR / layout]
    CS[Content Safety<br/>+ Prompt Shields]
  end

  KBSRC[SharePoint / FAQ /<br/>comms guidelines] --> ING[KB ingestion job<br/>Container Apps Job<br/>custom chunking]
  ING --> BLOB
  ING -->|scanned PDFs| DI
  ING -->|embeddings| LLM
  ING --> PG

  PG[(PostgreSQL + pgvector<br/>comments, drafts,<br/>audit, KB chunks)]

  SB --> CLS
  subgraph AGENT[Agent worker - Container App, KEDA]
    CLS[1. Classify<br/>language, sentiment, spam] --> RAG[2. Retrieve KB]
    RAG --> DRAFT[3. Draft + confidence/risk score]
  end
  CLS <--> LLM
  DRAFT <--> LLM
  RAG -->|query embedding| LLM
  RAG --> PG
  AGENT <-->|state| PG
  DRAFT --> CS

  CS --> ROUTE{Routing rules}
  ROUTE -->|spam / safe FAQ| AUTO[Auto action]
  ROUTE -->|normal| API
  ROUTE -->|legal / press / crisis| ESC[Escalation<br/>Teams / ServiceNow]
  ESC --> API

  UI[Review UI<br/>React + SignalR] <-->|REST + live feed| API[API service<br/>Container App]
  ENTRA[Entra ID] -.-> UI
  ENTRA -.-> API
  API <--> PG

  API -->|approve / edit| PUB[Publish worker]
  AUTO --> PUB
  PUB -->|reply / hide / delete| PLAT

  MON[App Insights /<br/>Log Analytics] -.-> AGENT
  MON -.-> API